*Dialog Box Keys,A
Dialog Box Keys
    <<F2>>           Pops-up choice list
    Tab or Enter Moves cursor to next item
    Shift-Tab    Moves cursor to previous item
    Space        Toggles check boxes   [ ]
                 Selects mode buttons ( )
